# documentation(links)
# Link tester

`links` is defined in `links.R`.

```r
links(x)
```

## Description

See `wmean()`, `stats::sd()`, `dplyr::mutate`, the docs and
`code`. A real [link](https://example.com) stays. `[x]` stays in code.

## Arguments

- `x`: Uses `stats::sd()`.

## Details

Details with `fn` link and x[i] indexing.

## Returns

A `list()`.

## Warnings

Be careful with `wmean()`.

Second paragraph.

